"description":"Your birth chart is a map of the moment you arrived. TimePassages helps you read it.\n\nUsed by astrologers since 2012, from curious beginners to seasoned professionals, TimePassages is the most trusted astrology app on the market. Every interpretation is written by real, experienced astrologers. Not AI. Not algorithms. Actual humans who have devoted their lives to this craft.\n\nYOUR BIRTH CHART, DEEPLY UNDERSTOOD\nYour chart is a map of your inner world, your drives, your gifts, your patterns, and your path. TimePassages gives you the depth to actually read it.\n\nYOUR DAILY HOROSCOPE, PERSONALLY YOURS\nUnlike generic sun-sign horoscopes, your daily horoscope is calculated from your unique birth chart. Every day, a personalized forecast based on exactly where the planets were when you were born and where they are right now.\n\nYOUR RELATIONSHIPS, ILLUMINATED\nSee the astrological dynamics between you and anyone in your life. Our Synastry and Composite charts reveal what is really at play, with interpretations that go beyond surface-level compatibility.\n\nYOUR TIMING, CLARIFIED\nTrack transits and progressions to understand why certain periods of your life feel the way they do, and what is coming next.\n\nFREE TO EXPLORE. PRO WHEN YOU ARE READY.\nYour birth chart and daily horoscope are always free. Upgrade for unlimited charts, forecasting, and the full TimePassages experience.\n\nThe original astrology app. Still the best one.", "bundleId":"com.astrograph.timepassagesfre", "trackCensoredName":"TimePassages Astrology", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/timepassages-astrology/id488946918?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":4.8359600000000000363797880709171295166015625, "userRatingCount":44119}, 
