"releaseNotes":"Ready to read your friends? Introducing the Charts tab. You can now add multiple charts to your app and dig into readings for all your besties. You just need their birth info to unlock (and save) their charts.\n\nWith the new Charts tab, you can:\n- Access unlimited charts\n- Dig into your friends’ natal readings\n- Toggle into the new table view\n- Brush up on your astro knowledge with interactive chart features\n\nWe hope you love it!\n— Team CHANI\n\nP.S. If you run into any trouble, email us at info@chani.com.", "version":"2.10.0", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"CHANI is the #1 astrology app made by real astrologers — not AI. Designed to make astrology accessible and useful, it combines ancient astro wisdom with mindfulness tools to help you unlock your full potential, tap into your personal power, and live out your life’s purpose. With CHANI, you can…\n\nGROUND INTO EACH DAY:\n- Understand how the day’s astrology will land for you and get tips on how to work with it with daily horoscopes.\n- Center yourself with a guided meditation highlighted to support the day’s astrological energy.\n- Create lunar magic with real-time readings that update with the Moon's movements.\n\nPREP FOR WHAT’S NEXT:\n- Check the astroweather forecast and ﻿tune in to the Astrology of the Week Ahead podcast for a breakdown of how the upcoming astro is showing up in the collective and on the world stage.\n- Listen to your weekly reading for a deeper, personalized look at how each week’s events will manifest in your life, and advice on how to make the most of them.\n- Work with the astro as it unfolds with weekly rituals, tarot cards, personalized journal prompts, and audio offerings curated to help you meet the moment — from New Moons and Full Moons to retrogrades, eclipses, and more.\n\nEXPLORE THE BLUEPRINT OF YOUR PURPOSE:\n- Uncover each planet and point’s position in your birth chart and learn how their positions and relationships play a role in your life. Then dig into your detailed astro insights and discover the gifts and challenges that your natal placements bring to the table.\n\nTRACK THE LESSONS OF YOUR TRANSITS:\n- Keep tabs on what sign each planet is currently in, whether or not it’s retrograde, and what all of that means for you personally with timely planetary horoscopes.\n- Access the wisdom that expert astrologers draw on (aka hyper-personalized transit readings) to learn how the planets are interacting with your unique birth chart at this exact moment.\n\nRESET YOUR NERVOUS SYSTEM + MANIFEST ABUNDANCE:\n- Browse our full library of guided meditations, affirmations, frequencies, and sleep stories to ground, decompress, dream, and access your inner wisdom.\n\nGROW THROUGH WHAT YOU GO THROUGH:\n- Overcome obstacles, transform your life, and ﻿reconnect with yourself through CHANI courses like the 7-part Saturn Return course and the viral 28-day Breakthrough course.\n\nFIND OUT WHAT THE FUTURE HOLDS:\n- ﻿Look ahead and unpack your year with personalized month-by-month readings, a zoomed-out astro overview, annual horoscopes for the four main areas of your life, and a collection of rituals, journal prompts, altar suggestions, and guided meditations dedicated to each of the year’s main themes.\n\nADD (AND READ) YOUR FRIENDS’ CHARTS:\n- Access unlimited charts and save up to 100 for easy reference.\n- Get to know your besties on another level with in-depth insights into their natal placements and their chart’s gifts and challenges.\n- Toggle between chart and table view for an at-a-glance astro overview.\n- Refresh your Astro 101 knowledge with interactive chart elements.\n\nWHO WE ARE:\nCHANI is a queer, feminist-led company that is anti-AI and not VC-funded. We’re on a mission to make astrology accessible and to support everyone in living their purpose — because we believe that astrology is a tool that can help transform us and our world for the better. We also believe that good business prioritizes personal wellbeing and promotes economic justice. No one on our team is paid less than $80K before benefits, and we offer a four-day workweek; fully covered health, dental, and vision insurance; unlimited menstrual leave; and more. In addition, 5% of all our company’s revenue is disbursed directly to survivors of gender-based violence via freefrom.org, and we’ve generated over $3.5 million for survivors to date. By choosing CHANI, you are investing in human talent, environmentally conscious technology, mutual aid, and mindful community.", "bundleId":"com.chaninicholas.chaniapp", "trackCensoredName":"CHANI: Your Astrology Guide", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/chani-your-astrology-guide/id1532791252?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"9+", "averageUserRating":4.91575000000000006394884621840901672840118408203125, "userRatingCount":59652}]
